The scene shows no clear actors (e.g., pedestrians, cyclists, or vehicles) in motion or static positions, so no specific `Actor` instances were included. The primary corner case here is classified as a `StateAnomaly` due to the environmental conditions (heavy rain and fog) altering the state of the road and visibility. The risks identified are all related to the adverse weather and road conditions.